            </div>
            {ANALYTICS_URL && (
              <a href={ANALYTICS_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="action-pill action-pill-accent">
                Open Plausible Dashboard &nearr;
              </a>
            )}
          </div>

          <div class="instruction-card">
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Telemetry &bull; Goal Setup in Plausible</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
              The site tracks interactions cleanly via <code>data-track</code> attributes through <code>public/rhsp-track.js</code>. To view conversions in your Plausible dashboard, register each of the following custom event goals:
            </p>

            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;">
              <div style="background: var(--color-bg-alt); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
                <strong style="display: block; font-size: 0.9375rem;">peg_item_click</strong>
                <span style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Triggered when any tile is clicked on the PEG Board.</span>
              </div>
              <div style="background: var(--color-bg-alt); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
                <strong style="display: block; font-size: 0.9375rem;">peg_zone_open</strong>
